       number (rule D-2), 14 UNRESOLVED with their reason (PART_NUMBER_INFERRED 10 on numbering-scheme sheets and Samsung's suffix, CHOICE_OWED 1 value-only rows,
       DOCUMENT_OWED 3); grades read at the source for 21 of them, NOT READ for 7. MOVED from OPEN toward PARTLY for the power parts: the block in pcb_part_identities.yaml holds them.
   6.2 supporting documents with revision, source and currency: 17 makers' documents named with title, revision, URL and sha256; 10 held back under their terms with one fetch
       script (fetch_held_back.py, the pins those of L4-E7, L4-E10 and L4-E11, every one fetched and matching on 3 October 2026); Samsung's three pages excerpted (date-stamped, not filed).
       MOVED: PARTLY, the power parts covered; the ZK sheet's URL and the 35E's maker copy stay owed.
   6.3 selection rationale recorded: one sentence per part pointing at its Layer 4 decision (28 of 28). MOVED to PARTLY for these parts (the passive majority of the boards is untouched).
   6.6 procurement constraints and alternatives: dated LCSC and JLCPCB readings for 32 codes, an alternative or NOT READ per part, the five-kit need against stock (finding L6P-F05);
       PROCUREMENT.md section 8 carries the table. MOVED to PARTLY for these parts.
